    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f170b29c-338f-4ab8-a5c4-f72c90826f69",
      "key": "b7b41b1b-4ef5-4b6f-af97-a5b5e56b3f60",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "f90b74e8-4c29-4d50-b6e2-875041f03c3c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursion travel \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEntrance fees to non-National Trust properties included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrain ticket on Day 2 included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide on Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGratuities included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "6993df63-8a5e-4248-a43d-25d5afa2101b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe stay four nights at the boutique 3* George Hotel in Norwich (\u003Ca href=\u0022https://georgehotel.co.uk/\u0022\u003Ehttps://georgehotel.co.uk/\u003C/a\u003E). Located a fifteen minute walk from the centre of Norwich, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant and bar. All rooms are en suite and feature telephone, television, hairdryer, and tea \u0026amp; coffee making facilities. A set 3 course dinner with a vegetarian option, and without drinks is included in our hotel on the first night. A choice 3 course dinner without drinks is included in our hotel on the remaining three nights of our tour.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a00f052f-2581-4b24-a04e-a49db5a87615",
      "key": "9f1e3df9-1a3d-438f-b8f7-a23eae00b48c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "a54da9bf-5795-4729-8699-d9ce0680aff3",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEly Cathedral \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorwich \u2013 guided city tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENarrow gauge railway excursion from Wroxham to Aylsham\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHolkham Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlickling Hall, Garden \u0026amp; Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESandringham Estate\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScenic drive along the North Norfolk coast road\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAnglesey Abbey, Garden \u0026amp; Lode Mill\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "00bcf358-6dfe-423f-b239-068ea6c77956",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "c6a7f2ac-8cb5-4bda-b920-76b452b77d56",
            "f90b74e8-4c29-4d50-b6e2-875041f03c3c",
            "6993df63-8a5e-4248-a43d-25d5afa2101b",
            "a54da9bf-5795-4729-8699-d9ce0680aff3",
            "ea143ee5-95b9-4613-bf99-fec41f5ccc8d",
            "f06598cd-e0a8-4348-b021-3f90f6b27fac",
            "9f1e3df9-1a3d-438f-b8f7-a23eae00b48c"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "c6a7f2ac-8cb5-4bda-b920-76b452b77d56",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe board our private executive coach at our designated pick up points. En route to our hotel we visit Ely Cathedral for a guided tour, known locally as \u2018The Ship of the Fens\u2019 and internationally famous for its Octagon and Lantern Towers. On arrival in Norwich we check in at the 3* George Hotel for a four night stay on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. We enjoy a guided coach and walking tour of Norwich, England\u2019s best preserved medieval city, taking in sights such as the Norman castle and the cathedral, one of the finest in England with its magnificent cloisters and Cathedral Close. This afternoon we enjoy an included one way narrow gauge railway excursion from Wroxham to Aylsham on the scenic Bure Valley Railway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning we visit Holkham Hall with our Blue Badge guide. Thomas Coke, the first Earl of Leicester, conceived the Palladian hall as his vision of an Italian villa on the windswept north Norfolk coast. We continue to the National Trust\u2019s Blickling Hall, Garden and Park. One of England\u2019s great Jacobean houses, Blickling is famed for its spectacular long gallery, superb plasterwork ceilings and fine collections of furniture, pictures, books and tapestries.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Sandringham Estate is our destination this morning, set in 60 acres of splendid gardens and the much loved country retreat of the late Her Majesty the Queen. Built for Edward VII in 1870 the property was once described as \u2018Britain\u2019s most comfortable house\u2019 and the museum houses extraordinary collections of royal vehicles, rare ceramics, photographs and memorabilia. With our Blue Badge guide this afternoon we enjoy a scenic drive along the North Norfolk coast road.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter checking out of our hotel and en route home we visit the National Trust\u2019s Anglesey Abbey, Garden and Lode Mill near Cambridge. This Jacobean style house, built on the site of a 12th century Augustinian priory contains a priceless art collection and one of the National Trust\u2019s largest collections of clocks. The celebrated garden, with its sweeping avenues, classical statuary and flower borders, offers captivating views, vibrant colours and delicious scents whatever the season. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route, we return back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
